    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Mushroom Shambler: model 478 (treesoldier_mushroom.adr) is in no client pack; the community host serves it and every file it names (scripts/dungeon_fights.py HOST_SERVED)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 11 ('Mushroom Cavern (the live dungeon: fungal beasts and bats across the caverns, Ma'): scene bw_mushroom_cave, 7 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Marasmius last; every spot is the fork's."
    },
    {
      "kind": "client",
      "evidence": "Card: Global.Text 4187, 103198, icon 676 (the fork battle's own ids)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: the scene bw_mushroom_cave needs one native load with this roster. The fork's scene layout, not a captured one; local kinds take ids 13032*100+n; knockouts, score, coins and the level gate are the fork fights' (fights/14xxx.json); job XP is the battles' 50."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) 1 later group(s) of the fork come as waves at their own spots: the first when the guards are down, each next one when the one before is down or 16 s after it (the captured Frostfang battle's gap)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done when the boss falls; the boss waits, dormant, for the waves. The results follow the exit door, which opens with the main goal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Built by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/mushroom_cavern.json, its notes page and the fork battle; under the id (13032) quests name."
    },
    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "L1197: knockouts 5, the page's own \"Don't get knocked out 5 times\" (fr_place_mushroom_cavern_342977.html); the generator's default was 15"
    },
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'FR Place:Mushroom Cavern' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Mushroom_Cavern.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's."}
